## Verification tiers (name the tier in every PR claim)

| Tier | How it runs | API source | Synthetic UI |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **T1 ingest-only** | `bash scripts/dev/aed-admin up` (db, redis, control `:8188`, web `:5173`) | **Live** `/api/v1` on control | **Forbidden:** page fixtures, silent chart backfill, fake promises |
| **T1+ data plane** | T1 + ClickHouse / full `stack.sh full` on operator machine | Live API + seeded PG/CH | Same as T1; seeds via `seed_*.sh`, not browser fixtures |
| **T2 embedded** | `web/dist` served from control binary | Live API same origin | **Forbidden:** any client-side mock intercept |
| **Chart preview** | `?chart_mock=1` on buyer dashboard only | Live API for shell; synthetic series in `dashboard_series_mock.ts` | Labeled in UI; not list/report proof |

**Rule:** Claiming handler wiring or OpenAPI parity requires **T1+** with `curl -sf :8188/health` and live `/api/v1` responses. `npm run dev` on `:5173` proxies to control -- it is not a separate mock tier.

### T1 sign-off checklist (before claiming ingest-only / handler wired)

Run on operator machine with control `:8188` healthy:

- [ ] `curl -sf http://127.0.0.1:8188/health` -- exit 0
- [ ] Navigate to the route under test on live API (not `chart_mock=1` unless chart-only claim)
- [ ] Wait for table / primary data surface (not heading-only paint)
- [ ] Row ids match Go seed / server create -- not trivial sequential placeholders
- [ ] Network tab: requests hit `/api/v1/...` (502 from dev proxy means control down)
- [ ] Force or simulate 5xx -- `ErrorBlock` / `role=alert` visible (not silent empty table)

## Visual and control contract (mandatory remediation)

Precedence: this section overrides legacy `ui.mdc` rows that allow `truncate`, fixed column clamps, or mixed button sizes until code is cleaned up.

### Custom styles (banned; remove on touch)

| Banned | Allowed exception |
| :--- | :--- |
| `style={{ ... }}` in `web/src/pages/`, `domains/`, `shell/` | Overlay positioning in `components/ui/{popover,select,tooltip,dropdown-menu}.tsx` (fixed coords) until moved to tokens |
| Per-route `className` height overrides on `Button`, `Input`, `SelectTrigger` | None -- use default primitive |
| Inline `style` on `<col>` / `<td>` / chart bars except campaigns width-probe pipeline | Campaign list: measured widths from `campaign_list_columns.ts` probe only |
| New `*.module.css` | None |
| BEM class hooks (`admin-*__*`, `campaign-*__*`, `block--modifier`) in TSX or new `app.css` blocks | None -- migrate legacy on touch |
| Arbitrary Tailwind `h-7` / `h-8` / `h-9` / `h-10` on controls in pages/domains/shell | `ui_slop.sh` already fails these |

**Audit (2026-09):** BEM `__` hooks and component blocks are **removed** from `domains/`, `shell/`, and `app.css` (see **Style inventory status**). Inline `style={{` remains only on allowed paths: campaign column probe widths (`campaigns_list_table.tsx` `<col>`), chart/bar data axes (`metric_fill_bar.tsx`, `dashboard_multi_axis_chart.tsx`), and similar **data-driven** layout -- not chrome. Remaining style work: inline audit on touch, not new global CSS blocks.

### Styling stack (Tailwind only; BEM banned)

**BEM is banned project-wide** (`block__element`, `block--modifier`, `admin-*__*`, `campaign-*__*`). It is a legacy pattern; do not add new blocks, hooks, or `@apply` component sheets. **One DOM node = Tailwind utilities in TSX** (via `components/ui` primitives where applicable).

**Pure CSS** in `web/src/styles/app.css` is allowed only where Tailwind alone cannot express the rule:

| Allowed in `app.css` | Examples |
| :--- | :--- |
| Tailwind entry | `@tailwind base/components/utilities`, `@layer base` minimal reset |
| Scrollbar pseudo-elements | `.ui-scrollbar` (`::-webkit-scrollbar*`) |
| Layout surface tokens (not BEM) | `.ui-filter-panel`, `.ui-surface`, `.ui-surface-raised`, `.ui-code-block`, `.ui-bento-card`, `.ui-shell*` |
| Data-table pin/selection chrome | `[data-directory-table]` sticky pin z-index and opaque row backgrounds |
| Print / font face | Rare; prefer `@fontsource` imports in TSX entry |
| **Forbidden** | Component BEM blocks (`block__element`, `block--modifier`); descendant selectors targeting `domains/` markup; `@apply` overrides of `components/ui` sizing |

Cross-ref: `ui.mdc` **Styling stack** (no `globals.css`; no new `*.module.css`).

**Canonical owners:**

| Owner | Where | Use for |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Primitive + Tailwind in TSX** | `components/ui/*`, `shell/*`, all `domains/*` | All new and touched UI |
| **Layout Tailwind on wrapper** | `domains/*` section roots | Macro/micro flex/grid only |
| **Dynamic inline / CSS var** | Width %, grid placement, overlay coords | Data-driven axis only -- not chrome duplicate |
| **Shared style contracts** | `admin_kit.ts`, `admin_chrome.ts`, `shell/*` layout consts, `domains/*/*_classes.ts` | Repeated identical chrome -- see **Shared style contracts** below |

#### Shared style contracts (named Tailwind constants)

**Not** CSS preprocessor macros, **not** BEM, **not** new `app.css` `@apply` blocks. These are **named `const` strings** (or small records) holding a **fixed Tailwind utility chain** reused wherever the same visual rule must stay identical.

Example (filter row matrices in `web/src/shell/filter_panel.tsx`):

```ts
// Prefer DirectoryFilterForm layout="auto-fill" | "campaigns" -- do not copy-paste grid strings in domains/.
const AUTO_FILL_FILTER_GRID = 'grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fill,12rem)] items-end gap-x-4 gap-y-4';
```

Consumers use the shell API (`DirectoryFilterForm layout="campaigns"`) -- they do **not** copy-paste the string.

##### When required (extract; do not duplicate inline)

| Situation | Action |
| :--- | :--- |
| Same chrome on **2+** routes or components | Export one named constant; import everywhere |
| Shell owns a layout matrix (filter grid, page section stack) | `const` beside the shell component; expose via props/`layout` enum |
| Table header / body / footer density identical across a directory family | `admin_chrome.tableHead` / `tableCell` or domain `*_classes.ts` until promoted |
| Control height, radius, caps label typography | `admin_kit` + `admin_chrome.control` on primitives -- never re-type `min-h-7 rounded-[5px] ...` per page |
| Second copy of an 8+ utility chain in a PR | Stop and extract before merge |

##### Where constants live (precedence)

| Tier | Path | Owns |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| T1 Semantic token | `web/src/lib/admin_kit.ts` | Single-purpose knobs: `controlHeight`, `labelCaps`, `tableRowHeight`, status badge maps |
| T2 Primitive chrome | `web/src/lib/admin_chrome.ts` | Composed strings consumed by `components/ui/*` (`tableHead`, `tableCell`, `buttonVariantClass`) |
| T3 Shell layout | Module `const` in `web/src/shell/<file>.tsx` | Layout matrices tied to one shell API (`filter_panel.tsx` `DIRECTORY_FILTER_GRID`, `CAMPAIGNS_FILTER_ROW`, `AUTO_FILL_FILTER_GRID`) |
| T4 Domain chrome | `web/src/domains/<domain>/*_classes.ts` | Directory-specific table/dialog chrome not yet shared (`campaign_list_classes.ts`) |
| T5 Cross-layer variant | `web/src/lib/*_classes.ts` (e.g. `campaign_picker_classes.ts`) | Variant strings `components/ui` needs without importing `domains/` |

**Promotion:** T4 -> T2/T1 when a second domain needs the same rule. **Demotion forbidden:** do not paste T3/T4 strings into random leaf TSX.

##### Boundaries (what this pattern is **not**)

| In scope | Out of scope |
| :--- | :--- |
| Header background, border width, row height, numeric alignment in tables | One-off gap between two buttons on a single page |
| Filter field grid template (`repeat(auto-fill,minmax(12rem,1fr))`) | Per-row business conditional classes (`selected && 'bg-accent'`) -- keep local `cn()` |
| Shared dialog footer button sizing | Data-driven `style={{ width: \`${pct}%\` }}` on spend bars / `<col>` probe widths |
| `whitespace-nowrap` on table headers and numeric cells | `truncate` on combobox option labels (allowlisted; not table data) |
| Named export used via shell prop / import | Copy-pasting the same 80-character `className` in five files without a named owner |
| Tailwind in TSX on the styled node | `app.css` descendant selectors that restyle primitives under a BEM hook |

##### Agent failure modes

| Failure | Correct |
| :--- | :--- |
| Re-type full table `th`/`td` classes in every directory | Import from `*_classes.ts` or extend `admin_chrome` |
| Add fourth filter grid string in a page file | Add `layout` value + `const` in `filter_panel.tsx` |
| New `app.css` block for "shared" table colors | Named Tailwind const + `className` on cells |
| Domain imports another domain's `*_classes.ts` | Promote shared slice to `admin_kit` / `admin_chrome` / `shell` |
| "Macro" = global CSS class hook | Named TS `const` only; `app.css` stays entry + scrollbar |

Verify: `rg -n "grid-cols-\\[repeat\\(auto-fill" web/src/domains` should hit imports or shell usage, not one-off page literals (except during extraction PR).

**Migration on touch:** remove `admin-*` / `campaign-*` from the file; move styles into `className` on the same node or delete the dead `app.css` block. Never add Tailwind `!` to fight leftover BEM.

#### Collision classes (never on new/touched code)

| Class | Mechanism | Symptom | Verdict |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **A. Same-node BEM + utility** | `className="admin-campaigns-list-footer flex flex-wrap gap-2"` | Two layout systems on one node; which `gap` wins depends on source order | **Slop** -- utilities only on wrapper, or migrate BEM to TSX |
| **B. Primitive + BEM + utility** | `<Button className="admin-campaigns-toolbar__outline-btn shrink-0 px-2" />` | `app.css` uses `@apply !h-auto min-h-7` to override `Button` defaults | **Slop** -- drop BEM hook; use `variant` / `className` on primitive only |
| **C. Tailwind `!` vs BEM** | `className="admin-campaigns-toolbar__filters !bg-transparent !p-0"` | Fighting parent chrome; symptom patch | **Slop** -- fix `FilterPanel` default styles, not `!` override |
| **D. Global descendant restyle** | `.admin-campaigns-filter-field :is(input, button) { @apply !h-auto ... }` | Input/Button classes ignored; filter row height drift | **Slop** -- style trigger via primitive `className`, not CSS descendant |
| **E. Contradictory utilities** | `h-8 ... h-auto min-h-8` on one `<button>` (`date_range_picker.tsx` admin footer) | Both apply; browser picks last in sheet | **Slop** -- one height token |
| **F. Contradictory layout** | `flex` and `grid` on same node (`metric_fill_bar.tsx`, fixed 2026-09) | Undefined used display | **Bug / slop** |
| **G. BEM + inline static** | BEM sets `bg-primary`; inline sets `width` only | OK if inline is **data-only** | **Allowed** when inline touches only dynamic axis |
| **H. Dynamic inline only** | `style={{ width: \`${pct}%\` }}` + Tailwind chrome on same bar fill | Width from data; radius/color from Tailwind | **Allowed** (campaign spend bar, column `<col>`) |
| **I. Token utilities only** | `text-ui-caption text-muted-foreground` | Both from `tailwind.config.ts` | **OK** -- not `app.css` BEM |
| **J. Overlay coords** | `style={{ position: 'fixed', top, left }}` in `popover.tsx` | No static layout duplicate in CSS | **Allowed** (`components/ui` only) |

