#### Remediation (when touching a file)

1. Remove `admin-*` / `campaign-*` class from the **same** element as Tailwind utilities; migrate block styles into `className` on that node or delete the CSS block.
2. Never add `app.css` rules that target `button`, `input`, or `[role=button]` inside domains -- set `className` on the primitive.
3. Ban new `@apply !` overrides of `components/ui` sizing; fix the primitive or variant once.
4. Dynamic layout (grid row index, column width, chart color): **inline or CSS variable** for that property only -- do not duplicate radius/padding/border in both layers.
5. CI: `ui_slop.sh` flags `admin-*` on same `className` as Tailwind `!` important utilities.

### Button (single template)

| Rule | Detail |
| :--- | :--- |
| Component | `@/components/ui/button` only -- no raw `<button className="admin-btn">` |
| Size | **Default only** -- `size` prop must be `default` or omitted |
| Height | One control height (`min-h-7` / `--admin-control-height`); identical on every toolbar, table, dialog footer |
| Width | `inline-flex`; width follows label text + padding -- no fixed `w-*` on standard actions |
| Banned | `size="sm"`, `size="lg"`, `size="icon"` in `pages/`, `domains/`, `shell/` (`ui_slop.sh`) |

### Typography and wrapping

| Content class | Wrap | Classes |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Body / prose** | **Yes** -- descriptions, help text, footers, EULA, error messages, `EmptyState` body, `StubBanner` message | `whitespace-normal`, no `truncate` / `line-clamp` |
| **Headings** | **No** -- page titles, section titles, table column headers, nav labels | `whitespace-nowrap`; no `truncate`, no `line-clamp` |
| **Numbers / metrics** | **No** -- KPI values, money, counts, IDs in tables, `tabular-nums` cells | `whitespace-nowrap`; no ellipsis |
| **Breadcrumb current title** | **No** | Same as headings |

Banned on headings and numeric cells: `truncate`, `line-clamp-*`, `text-overflow: ellipsis`, `max-w-*` used only to force clipping.

**Audit (2026-09):** P2 removed `truncate` from summary/refresh bands and most directory headings. Remaining allowlist: combobox/select option labels (`searchable_filter_select.tsx`, `select.tsx`, `datetime_picker.tsx`). **Fixed-layout directory tables** (campaigns width-probe, landers percent `col` widths) may use `text-ellipsis` only via `campaignListEllipsisTextClass` / `campaignListHeaderLabelClass` in `campaign_list_classes.ts` -- not ad-hoc in domain TSX; never on numeric/KPI cells. `ui_slop.sh` fails `truncate` on `h1`-`h6`.

### Table columns (width = content)

| Rule | Detail |
| :--- | :--- |
| Default | `table-layout: auto`; column widths from content; horizontal scroll in directory wrap when needed |
| Forbidden | `max-w-0` + `truncate` on `TableCell`; `max-w-md` + `truncate` on data cells; dead gap from stretching one column |
| Campaigns | Width probe + explicit `col` widths allowed; widths must reflect measured content, not arbitrary caps |
| Header cells | `whitespace-nowrap`; full label visible in auto-layout tables |
| Fixed-layout ellipsis | `table-layout: fixed` + explicit `col` widths only: import `campaignListEllipsisTextClass` / `campaignListHeaderLabelClass` from `campaign_list_classes.ts` (campaigns list, landers list). **Banned:** inline `text-ellipsis` in `domains/**`; ellipsis on money/count/metric cells |

### Fixed-layout directory tables (ellipsis)

| Table | Width source | Ellipsis classes |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Campaigns list | `campaign_list_column_widths.ts` probe | `campaignListEllipsisTextClass`, `campaignListHeaderLabelClass` |
| Landers list | Percent `colgroup` (`landers_list_table.tsx`) | Same named imports -- no duplicate strings in creative domain |

Numeric body cells: `campaignListCellContentNumClass` (`whitespace-nowrap`, no ellipsis). Long URLs/names: ellipsis + `title` for full value on hover/focus.

## Overlays, scroll surfaces, and control height

Three **distinct** UI surface classes. Mixing them (sidebar behavior on a combobox, or a popover that scrolls with page content instead of anchoring to its trigger) is frontend slop.

Layout chain for page scroll: `ui.mdc` (**Scroll and overflow**). Implementation: `web/src/lib/overlay_root.tsx`, `web/src/lib/floating_overlay_position.ts`, `web/src/components/ui/{popover,select,dropdown-menu,dialog,sheet}.tsx`.

### Surface taxonomy (required)

| Class | Examples | DOM / position | Scroll owner | Trigger relationship |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **A. Shell dock** | `AppSidebar`, `AppMobileNavSheet` | In app grid (`app_shell.tsx`); **no** `OverlayRoot` portal | Own `ui-scrollbar overflow-y-auto` region (`app_sidebar.tsx` nav) | Header toggle shows/hides shell; **not** positioned under the toggle like a menu |
| **B. Anchor float** | `Select`, `DropdownMenu`, `Popover`, `CustomerCombobox`, country picker, date range | `OverlayRoot` -> `document.body`; `position: fixed` coords from **trigger** `getBoundingClientRect()` | **Inner** `max-h-*` + `ui-scrollbar overflow-y-auto` on list body; wheel must not scroll page behind (`CommandList` `stopPropagation`) | Opens at trigger; **repositions** on ancestor scroll/resize via `subscribeFloatingPosition` |
| **C. Modal / sheet** | `Dialog`, `CommandDialog`, import `Sheet` | Portal + backdrop; centered or edge sheet | One `flex-1 overflow-y-auto` body; bottom padding so last field is not clipped | Blocks page interaction; not anchored to a field trigger |

**Operator rule (2026-09):** left nav and mobile nav sheet = **A**. Campaign/customer/country dropdowns = **B** with their own scrollbar. Never treat **B** as viewport-sticky chrome that rides page scroll while the trigger moves away.

### Anchor float (class B) -- required behavior

| Rule | Detail |
| :--- | :--- |
| Primitive only | `Select` / `DropdownMenu` / `Popover` from `components/ui/`; extend `admin_chrome.ts`, not hand-rolled `[data-dropdown-open]` |
| Trigger ref | `PopoverTrigger` / `DropdownMenuTrigger` / `SelectTrigger` must own `triggerRef` via `Slot` + `mergeRefs`; domain code may add a ref for `resolvePopoverAlign` only -- must not replace context ref |
| Reposition | `subscribeFloatingPosition(trigger, updatePosition)` on every open float; recomputes `getBoundingClientRect()` on scroll (capture) + `resize` |
| Detach symptom | Menu stays at fixed viewport Y while trigger scrolls off-screen = **bug** (missing scroll container, broken `triggerRef`, or bypassing primitives) |
| List scroll | Long lists: `ui-scrollbar max-h-60` (`select.tsx`, `dropdown_menu_scroll.ts`), `CommandList`, or domain wrapper (`campaign_list_columns_menu.tsx` `max-h-72` grid) |
| Panel scroll | `PopoverContent` `panelScroll`: default `panel`; `p-0` comboboxes -> `inner` (child owns scroll); `none` only when content fits viewport (e.g. compact calendar) |
| z-index | Float `z-index` 60; shell header/control panel `z-[5]` must stay below floats |
| Dismiss | `useOverlayDismiss` (Escape, outside click) |

Canonical flows: `select.tsx` (inner scroll div), `popover.tsx` + `command.tsx` (`CommandList`), `dropdown-menu.tsx` + `dropdown_menu_scroll.ts`, `campaign_list_country_select.tsx` (`campaign_list_classes.ts` list const).

### Shell dock (class A) -- required behavior

| Rule | Detail |
| :--- | :--- |
| Layout slot | Sidebar is a column in `app_shell.tsx`, not a portal under the header button |
| Independent scroll | Nav list scrolls inside aside; `main` / `PageLayout` `.admin-page-main` scrolls page content separately |
| Collapse | Desktop: `hidden md:flex` aside when expanded; `collapsed` hides aside. Mobile: aside always hidden; `AppMobileNavSheet` (class C left edge) with dock nav scroll -- not a class-B popover |
| Banned | Portal + `position: fixed` for full page nav; duplicating nav in a `DropdownMenu` attached to sidebar toggle without sheet semantics |

### Modal / sheet (class C)

| Rule | Detail |
| :--- | :--- |
| Scroll | Single body scroll region; sticky footer outside scroll where needed (`date_range_picker` Apply row, dialog footers) |
| Page behind | Dialog backdrop; do not rely on page scroll while modal open |
| Command palette | `CommandDialog` = class C (viewport modal), not class B |

### Control height in one semantic row (filter toolbar, dialog footer, table header actions)

| Rule | Detail |
| :--- | :--- |
| Canonical token | `admin_kit.controlHeight` -> `min-h-7` + `text-[13px] leading-[18px]` via `adminChrome.control` on `Input`, `SelectTrigger`, default `Button` |
| One row | Every interactive control in the same filter row / toolbar / footer: **same** height token -- no mixing `min-h-7` trigger with `h-8` search or `h-10` table header chrome in the same row |
| Primitives | `Button` default size only in `domains/` / `shell/`; `Input` / `SelectTrigger` without manual `h-*` overrides |
| Icon-only | Square icon actions in a data row may use `h-7 w-7` when isolated from text controls -- not beside `min-h-7` selects in one filter group |
| Banned cite | `control_size.ts` -- **deleted**; never reference dual `h-8` contract |

### Overlay and height slop (never)

| Slop | Symptom | Correct |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Viewport-stuck float** | Dropdown stays on screen while trigger scrolls away | Fix `triggerRef` + `subscribeFloatingPosition`; scroll container must be in `collectScrollContainers` chain (`overflow` auto/scroll/overlay) |
| **Page scroll inside menu** | Wheel on open menu scrolls `.admin-page-main` instead of list | Inner `overflow-y-auto` + `max-h-*`; `onWheel` stopPropagation on list (`CommandList`) |
| **No list cap** | `DropdownMenuContent` grows to full item count; page scrolls | Wrap items in `ui-scrollbar max-h-* overflow-y-auto` (or use `Select` / `CommandList`) |
| **Shell as popover** | Full nav in `DropdownMenu` from header toggle | `AppSidebar` or mobile `Sheet` with dock scroll |
| **Height drift** | Customer combobox `Button`, country `min-h-7`, date picker `min-h-7`, header search `h-8` in one toolbar | One `adminChrome.control` / default primitive height on all fields in the row |
| **Table header vs filters** | `DirectoryTable` head `h-10` beside `min-h-7` filters in same visual band | Accept header as separate band; do not put `h-10` controls in filter `FilterPanel` rows |
| **Hand-rolled position** | `absolute`/`fixed` menu div in `domains/` without `floating_overlay_position` | Class B primitives only |
| **Radix fiction** | Docs say Radix portal | First-party `OverlayRoot` + `components/ui/*` |

