## Layout contract (Flex, Grid, semantic tables)

Agents confuse **`gap` between unrelated bands**, **`justify-between` as spacer**, **flex page shells**, and **CSS Grid matrices** where a semantic `<table>` is required. Macro/micro split: `ui.mdc` **Layout (macro Grid, micro Flex)**. This section is the **enforcement** catalog for new and touched UI.

### Layer ownership

| Layer | Layout engine | Examples |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Macro page** | CSS Grid (section stack) | `PageLayout` body, filter field matrix, dashboard/bento tiles, `aside` split (`page_layout.tsx`) |
| **Micro component** | Flexbox | Button label + icon, chip, dialog footer button row, **inside one grid cell** |
| **Homogeneous data rows** | Semantic `<table>` | Directory lists, ops tables -- **never** a div grid matrix |
| **Forbidden** | Flex column replacing page grid | Nested `flex flex-col` page roots that own filters + table + footer as one flex child list without section wrappers |

### `gap` semantics (required)

**`gap` only between siblings that are one semantic group at the same hierarchy level.**

| Allowed `gap` | Meaning |
| :--- | :--- |
| `flex gap-2` on a **button group** | Refresh, Export, Create -- peers in one toolbar cluster |
| `grid gap-4` on a **filter field matrix** | Spacing between labeled field cells only (`repeat(auto-fill, minmax(12rem, 1fr))`) |
| `flex flex-col gap-2` on **one section band** | `PageLayout` workspace: controlPanel / main / footer are separate children; `gap-2` between bands, not `gap-6` mixing unrelated chrome |
| `gap-1` / `gap-2` inside a control | Select trigger icon + label; metric label + value in one row |

| Banned `gap` use | Why | Fix |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Large `gap-*` on a parent mixing filters + table + unrelated actions | `gap` is not section margin between bands | One wrapper per band; small `gap-2` between band wrappers only |
| `gap` + `justify-between` to push groups apart | `gap` adds space **between every** flex child; fights `justify-between` at wrap | Explicit grid tracks (below) |
| `gap` between **two tool groups** that should pin to opposite edges | Groups are not one peer set | `grid-cols-[1fr_auto]` or `grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto]` |
| `flex-1` sibling + `gap` to fake empty middle | Elastic spacer, unstable at resize | Dedicated `1fr` **empty grid track** |

### Spacing between groups (not `gap`)

When two **distinct** UI bands need separation (title vs actions, left summary vs right buttons, field block vs Apply cluster):

| Pattern | When |
| :--- | :--- |
| `grid-cols-[1fr_auto]` | Title / filters left, actions right (`team_overview.tsx`, `customer_scope_bar.tsx`) |
| `grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto]` | Left tools, **empty elastic middle track**, right actions |
| `grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fill,minmax(12rem,1fr))]` + **separate grid children** | Apply and Prev/Next are **direct grid children**, not a flex row with `ml-auto` inside a field cell (`ui.mdc` **Directory filter row**) |
| `col-span-full` + new row | Pagination or summary on its own row under the filter matrix |
| Outer `flex flex-col gap-2` between **wrappers** | Each wrapper is one band; inner layout uses `gap` only within the band |

**Banned for inter-group space:**

- `ml-auto` / `ms-auto` on a flex child to escape its grid cell (`ui.mdc` **No layout escape**)
- Empty `<div className="flex-1" />` spacer nodes
- `justify-between` on a row with **three or more** unrelated groups (toolbar with filters + bulk actions + pagination)

**Allowed `justify-between`:** exactly **two** peers in one micro-control (Select trigger: value + chevron; alert: message + dismiss; metric row: label + number).

```tsx
// OK: gap only inside one button group
<div className="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
  <Button>Refresh</Button>
  <Button>Create</Button>
</div>

// OK: two bands -- elastic left track pushes actions right
<header className="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-center gap-2">
  <h1>Campaigns</h1>
  <div className="flex items-center gap-2">{actions}</div>
</header>

// OK: three tracks -- middle 1fr is the empty column (explicit col placement)
<div className="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] items-center">
  <LeftTools className="col-start-1" />
  <RightActions className="col-start-3 flex gap-2" />
</div>

// Slop: justify-between mixes title group + actions + third cluster
<header className="flex justify-between gap-4">...</header>

// Slop: flex-1 spacer
<div className="flex">
  <Filters />
  <div className="flex-1" />
  <Apply />
</div>
```

### Flex rules

| Rule | Detail |
| :--- | :--- |
| One display per node | Never `flex` and `grid` on the same element |
| Scope | Toolbar button row, chip, footer controls, content **inside one table cell** |
| `flex-col` | Vertical stack inside **one section** with `min-h-0` chain (`ui.mdc` **Flex/grid min-height chain**) |
| `flex-1` | Grow scroll regions inside a known flex parent (`main`, table wrap) -- **not** as dead space between unrelated siblings |
| `flex-wrap` | Button groups that may wrap -- not page macro layout |

### CSS Grid rules (non-tabular)

| Surface | Pattern |
| :--- | :--- |
| Filter field matrix | `grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fill,minmax(12rem,1fr))] gap-4 items-end` |
| Dashboard / bento | `repeat(auto-fit, minmax(18rem, 1fr))` |
| Label + value detail | `sm:grid-cols-[10rem_1fr]` |
| Main + aside | `lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(16rem,22rem)]` (`page_layout.tsx`) |

| Rule | Detail |
| :--- | :--- |
| `gap` on grid | Between **peer cells** of the same matrix only |
| One template per axis | Section root owns `grid-template-columns`; do not nest a second grid for the same row |
| `min-h-0` / `minmax(0,1fr)` | Required on flex/grid ancestors above scroll containers |

### Semantic `<table>` vs CSS Grid (decision table)

| Use semantic `<table>` (`DirectoryTable`, `OpsTable`, `components/ui/table`) | Use CSS Grid |
| :--- | :--- |
| Paginated or sortable **directory** (`items[]` homogeneous rows) | Stat tiles, settings bento, form field matrices |
| Column resize, reorder, sticky `thead`, `colgroup` widths | Popover mini-grids (`grid-cols-2` inside one cell) |
| Tabular numbers, column alignment, `tabular-nums` | Key-value detail blocks |
| Ops / audit lists with stable row identity | Decorative layout with no column contract |

**Mandatory for data directories:** `<table>` + `<thead>` / `<tbody>` + `key={columnId}` on `<th>` / `<td>`. Raw `<table>` in `domains/` is banned -- use `DirectoryTable` / `OpsTable` (`ui_slop.sh`).

**Banned as a data table:**

- `div` with `grid-cols-*` iterating server rows
- Flex row per "record" mimicking columns
- Virtualized div lists without per-column cell identity

**Allowed:** CSS Grid **inside** a `<td>` for cell-local layout only.

**Performance:** div-grid "tables" repaint the whole matrix when one header interaction fires; semantic table + `React.memo` body rows + header-local drag/resize state is canonical (**Directory tables** below).

### Layout slop (never)

| Slop | Symptom | Correct |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Page root `flex flex-col gap-6` with filters + table + footer as flat children | One `gap` pool treats unrelated bands as one group | `PageLayout` bands; `gap-2` between wrappers |
| `justify-between` toolbar (3+ clusters) | Wrap breaks alignment; gap uneven | `grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto]` or separate rows |
| Filter row `flex` + `ml-auto` on Apply | Apply escapes field grid | Apply as **direct grid child** after fields |
| Campaigns list as CSS Grid | No `colgroup`, column reorder breaks | `DirectoryTable` + semantic table |
| `flex` + `grid` on one node | Undefined used `display` | One owner per element |

Reference: `web/src/shell/page_layout.tsx`, `web/src/shell/filter_panel.tsx`, `web/src/domains/campaigns/list/campaigns_list_toolbar.tsx`, `web/src/domains/team/team_overview.tsx`.

## Visual layout drift taxonomy (causes, symptoms, diagnosis)

**Binding:** operators report "съезжает", "плывёт", "не на месте", "порядок нарушен" as **measurable layout defects** -- not taste. Agents must map each report to a **VL-*** catalog ID, DOM band, and falsify command. Subjective "looks aligned" is banned (**AP-L2**).

Cross-ref: **Styling stack** collision **A-J** (style fights); **Layout contract** (gap/grid); **Overlays** class A/B/C; **Directory tables** (column lifecycle); `ui.mdc` **Scroll and overflow**, **Directory filter row**.

### Diagnostic protocol (mandatory before "fixed layout")

| Step | Action | Output |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **VL-D1 Band** | Name surface: shell header, filter matrix, table head, table body, footer, dialog body, float menu | One band per finding |
| **VL-D2 Peers** | List sibling controls in the band (Apply, Select, Search, pagination) | Expected same baseline / grid row |
| **VL-D3 Grep** | Run **Keyword index (layout drift)** on file + band | Paste `rg` command + hits |
| **VL-D4 Mechanism** | Assign **VL-*** ID; cite `file:line` + computed cause (not symptom alone) | One ID per root cause |
| **VL-D5 Verify** | After fix: `bash scripts/ci/admin/ui_slop.sh` on touched paths; visual check at 1280px and narrow wrap | Paste exit code or **not run** |

DevTools (operator or agent with screenshot): compare **computed** `display`, `height`, `gap`, `align-items` on peer controls in one filter row. Mismatched `height` / `min-height` across peers = **VL-11** until proven otherwise.

### Operator symptom -> likely cause (triage)

| Operator symptom (RU/EN) | VL-ID(s) | First check |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Кнопки/поля в фильтре на разной высоте | **VL-11**, **VL-12** | `rg 'h-[789]|min-h-'` in toolbar; default primitives only |
| Apply / Prev-Next не в той ячейке / уехали вправо | **VL-09**, **VL-14** | `filter_panel.tsx` DOM; `ml-auto`, wrapped Apply |
| Тулбар при сужении окна "ломается" / непредсказуемый перенос | **VL-08**, **VL-07** | `justify-between` with 3+ clusters; large `gap` on mixed parent |
| Дропдаун остался на экране, триггер уехал | **VL-13** | `triggerRef`, `subscribeFloatingPosition` |
| Список скроллится под открытым меню | **VL-13b** | `dropdown_menu_scroll.ts`, `CommandList` `onWheel`, inner `max-h-*` |
| Низ таблицы / формы обрезан | **VL-10** | `min-h-0` chain from `app_shell.tsx` to scroll region |
| Колонки таблицы скачут при resize/drag | **VL-17**, **VL-19** | `setState` on `dragover`; `width: 100%` on table + probe |
| Пустой зазор между колонками campaigns | **VL-19** | `campaign_list_column_widths.ts`, saved widths |
