## User action coalescing (frontend idempotency)

**Problem:** the user clicks Refresh / Load / Export several times within a short window. Each click starts a new fetch, `setState` cycle, and VDOM reconcile -- even when `useResource` aborts the previous request. Server sees request storms; React sees redundant `fetching` toggles and snapshot replaces. This is **not** server idempotency (`cold-path.mdc` outbox keys); it is **UI-level coalescing**: many clicks in one time slice = **one intent**.

**Canonical rule:** every user-triggered **read** or **write** that hits `/api/v1` must pass through a **single gate** in the **owner** (page hook or workspace hook). Leaves pass `onRefresh` / `onSubmit` only; they do not start fetches directly.

### Action classes

| Class | Examples | Coalesce strategy | Default window |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **R1. Manual read / refetch** | Refresh list, Reload status, `refreshToken++` | **Leading window** + **in-flight guard** | **500 ms** |
| **R2. Explicit mutation** | Save, Delete, Pause, Import, Export run | **In-flight guard** only (until 2xx or error) | Until settled |
| **R3. Filter Apply** | Directory filter submit | Single submit event; no per-keystroke fetch | N/A (draft/applied split) |
| **R4. Pagination / sort** | Prev/Next, column sort header | Intentional discrete actions; no throttle | None |
| **R5. High-frequency pointer** | Column resize, drag highlight | rAF throttle (`react.mdc`, **Directory tables**) | ~16 ms |

**Leading window:** first click in `windowMs` runs the action; further clicks before the window ends are **dropped** (same user intent). **In-flight guard:** while the async handler promise is pending, ignore additional clicks even after the window expires.

**Not sufficient alone:** `useResource` abort on dep change -- rapid `refreshToken` bumps still **start** N requests and abort N-1. Coalesce **before** bumping deps or calling fetch.

### Required UI contract

| Control | Minimum |
| :--- | :--- |
| Mutation button | `disabled={busy}` + `loading={busy}` on `Button` until handler `finally` |
| Manual refresh | `disabled={fetching}` **and** coalesced handler in owner hook |
| Form submit | `type="submit"`; block double submit with `submitting` flag |
| Success toast | Only after `await` resolves 2xx (`anti-slop.mdc` admin slop) |

### Owner hook shape (required for R1/R2)

```tsx
// R2 mutation -- in-flight guard only (integrations_platform_campaigns_page.tsx pattern)
const [refreshing, setRefreshing] = useState(false);
const onRefresh = useCallback(async () => {
  if (refreshing) return;
  setRefreshing(true);
  try {
    await refreshPlatformCampaignLink(...);
    setRefreshToken((n) => n + 1);
  } finally {
    setRefreshing(false);
  }
}, [refreshing, ...]);

// R1 manual list refresh -- coalesce before refreshToken bump
const refreshList = useCoalescedCallback(
  () => setRefreshToken((n) => n + 1),
  { windowMs: 500, inFlightGuard: true, inFlight: listFetching },
);
// Canonical helper: web/src/lib/coalesced_user_action.ts (add when touching handlers)
```

Until `coalesced_user_action.ts` lands, inline `useRef` lastFiredAt + `if (inFlight) return` in the **same** owner hook -- not copy-pasted per leaf button.

### Coalescing collision classes (never on new/touched code)

| Class | Mechanism | Symptom | Verdict |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **A. Unguarded refreshToken** | Each Refresh click `setRefreshToken(n+1)` | Abort storm; list metrics refetch in parallel | **Slop** -- leading window + in-flight |
| **B. Leaf starts fetch** | Toolbar `onClick={() => void listCampaigns()}` | Bypasses owner; duplicate with `useResource` | **Slop** -- owner gate only |
| **C. disabled without in-flight** | `disabled={fetching}` but handler has no `if (busy) return` | Keyboard repeat / race before `fetching` flips true | **Slop** -- guard inside handler too |
| **D. loading without disabled** | Spinner only | Double submit | **Slop** -- `Button` sets both |
| **E. Toast before await** | `toast.success` before `await` completes | False success on double click | **Slop** |
| **F. Parallel duplicate hooks** | Two `useResource` for same query keyed only by overlapping deps | Double traffic on one user action | **Slop** -- one fetch owner |
| **G. Trailing debounce on Refresh** | Wait for click burst to end | User sees no response until pause | **Wrong pattern** for R1 -- use **leading** |
| **H. Throttle pagination** | Prev/Next throttled | Skipped page turns | **Banned** on R4 |

