## Request fan-out (RF-*)

**Definition:** one operator intent, route transition, or refresh token causes **N network or heavy operations** where a smaller set would satisfy the same UI contract. Distinct from **R1** (same Refresh clicked N times) and **ownership F** (two writers for one object). **R1** stops duplicate *clicks*; **RF-*** stops one click from starting redundant *lanes*.

Normative fetch lifecycle: `react.mdc` **Fetch and abort**. Session dedupe contrast: `lib/command_palette_routes_cache.ts`, `lib/report_catalog_cache.ts`.

### Collision classes (never on new/touched code)

| ID | Pattern | Symptom | Fix |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **RF-1** | Global `refreshToken` in deps of unrelated `useResource` hooks | One Refresh refetches facets, aux endpoints, and lists that did not change | Scoped tokens: `listRefreshToken`, `facetsToken` (bump only when customer changes); drop token from slow-changing aux |
| **RF-2** | Unguarded `setRefreshToken` / `setReloadToken` on manual Refresh | Each click starts full hook fan-out (abort prior, still N new requests) | `useCoalescedCallback` (**R1**) + scope what the token bumps |
| **RF-3** | Child overlay fetches data parent already loaded | Popover/sheet `getCampaignStats` while row has `metricsById` / batch metrics | Pass snapshot as initial; fetch only for deeper series or stale miss |
| **RF-4** | Same session-scoped catalog refetched per page visit | `listCustomers` on campaigns, dashboard, click_log with identical query | Module cache + inflight dedupe (`fetchCommandPaletteRoutesCached` shape) |
| **RF-5** | List entire collection to resolve one label/id | `listBrands` on creatives page to breadcrumb one brand | `getBrand(id)`, nav state, or breadcrumb from route loader |
| **RF-6** | Effect epoch bump **and** same key already in `useResource` deps | Double fetch on `id` change (ledger reset + hook rerun) | Reset local cursor in effect only; or epoch for mutations-only |
| **RF-7** | Boot providers hit same endpoint independently | `MetaProvider` `getMeta` + `composeSessionBootstrap` fallback `getMeta` | Single meta promise cache; bootstrap returns meta; skip MetaProvider fetch when present |
| **RF-8** | Mutation refresh over-broadcasts to unrelated surfaces | Team invite bumps overview + roster when only roster changed | Split refresh tokens per surface |
| **RF-9** | Directory snapshot fan-out without scoped lanes | Campaigns Apply -> up to 5 parallel: list, width-probe list, metrics batch, totals, facets | Accept when each endpoint is required; trim: facets off refresh token; probe gated (`listCoversWidthProbeDataset`) |
| **RF-10** | Open-gated fetch always cold | Metrics popover refetches on every open even when parent batch is fresh | TTL or pass-through props; refetch on explicit "Refresh" only |

