| **RP-1** | `useCallback` on every handler; no `memo` child | Deps churn; false optimization | Plain functions unless memo child needs stability |
| **RP-2** | `useMemo` for trivial filter; `filter` + `some` id dedup | O(n*m) for no gain on small lists | Inline or `Set`; memo only when costly |
| **RP-3** | 5+ correlated `useState` for one async surface (`loading`, `error`, `items`, `degraded`, …) | Desynced flags after overlapping requests | `useResource` or `useReducer` with one status object |
| **RP-4** | Two fetch lanes share `loading` / `error` | Search typing clears catalog error; spinner fights | Separate lane state or two `useResource` hooks |
| **RP-5** | Identical list-row JSX duplicated 2+ in one file | Style/copy drift; triple edit on change | Extract `<XRow item onSelect />` in same module or `shell/` |
| **RP-6** | Add TanStack Query / SWR for admin lists | New stack; diverges from `use_resource.ts` | Domain hook wrapping `useResource` + debounce |

