| Claim | Falsify |
| :--- | :--- |
| "One way to create" | Grep page for duplicate verbs / POST handlers |
| "Modal dismissible" | Keyboard-only test: Escape closes; X visible; destructive has Cancel |
| "Script documented" | PR lists script table or links OpenAPI required fields |
| "No scenario race" | Cannot open two create surfaces; double-click one POST |

**E2E:** mutation specs must follow script steps (**Test honesty** L2). **Playwright** must not use soft OR to hide UX-J.

