### Validation ownership (no duplicate fiction)

| Concern | Owner | Client role |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Required fields / types | OpenAPI + Go handler S4 | C1/C2 mirror for UX |
| FK exists (campaign, customer) | Server DB / service lookup | Optional prefetch; server always checks |
| Money micro-units, UUID shape | Server parse (`ParsePathUUID`, billing helpers) | Input `inputMode`, regex hints only |
| License / quota | Server S3/S5 | `StubBanner` / `403` message |
| Idempotency / revision | Server S5 + outbox | Show `409` conflict to operator |

