| ID | Pattern | Why slop | Explicit alternative |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **EH-TH1** | `toast.success` before `await` completes | Phantom success | EC5 |
| **EH-TH2** | Playwright `table.or(empty).or(stub)` | Greens on failure | **Test honesty** L3 |
