#### Wrong envelope (**EH-EN**)

| ID | Pattern | Why slop | Explicit alternative |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **EH-EN1** | Plain `{ "message": "..." }` without `error` wrapper | `parseApiError` misses code | `httpresponse.Error` shape |
| **EH-EN2** | Success DTO shape on 4xx body | Client parse drift | Error envelope only on non-2xx |
| **EH-EN3** | Bare `[]` when OpenAPI says `{ items, total }` | `.map` crash / lie | `emptyList()` vs `emptyArray()` |

### Decision matrix (operator-visible)

| Situation | Explicit handling | Slop |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| GET list returns `500` | `ErrorBlock` "Could not load …" | Empty table, no message |
| PATCH invalid field | `400` + modal `ErrorBlock` with message | `200` + success toast |
| Feature not in license | `403`/`501` + `StubBanner` | Demo rows without banner |
| Network / timeout | `ApiError` / `TIMEOUT` + `ErrorBlock` | Stuck loading or fake `[]` |
| Stale list + refresh fails | Rows remain + error toast/banner | Clear table |
| Chart preview active | `?chart_mock=1` without labeled preview | Synthetic KPIs presented as live API |
| User aborts fetch | No error UI (`isAbortError`) | Red error for cancel |

### Error parity (live API and chart preview)

There is no in-browser mock intercept. Bad-input parity is proven on **Go handlers** (`go test ./internal/controlplane/...`) and **L3** Playwright where applicable.

| Explicit | Slop |
| :--- | :--- |
| `404`/`400` + `{ error: { code, message } }` from live API | `genericOk()` on PATCH/POST in domain code |
| Unknown route -> real 404 from control | Catch-all fake `200` in client |
| `chart_mock=1` labeled in dashboard copy | Silent synthetic KPIs on T1 without query flag |

