| :--- | :--- |
| "Errors handled" | Grep `catch` in touched files -- every path reaches EC2/EC4/EC6 |
| "Graceful degradation" | Often **EH-ST1** -- require `StubBanner` or `ErrorBlock` |
| "Fails closed" | Force 4xx/5xx in Network -- operator must see message, not empty grid |
| "Mock wired" | Force 4xx/5xx on live API -- operator must see message |
| "E2E covers errors" | **L3** spec with `role=alert` / `ErrorBlock`, not `or(stub)` |

