#### Real E2E (minimum bar when claiming L1+)

**Bad** -- heading-only; does not falsify mock intercept or API shape:

```javascript
test('campaigns load', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.goto('/campaigns');
  await expect(page.locator('h1')).toContainText('Campaigns');
});
```

**Bad** -- soft OR (FE2):

```javascript
await expect(table.or(empty).or(stub)).toBeVisible();
```

**Good** -- **L1** read contract:

```javascript
test('campaigns load', async ({ page }) => {
  await loginAsAdmin(page);
  await page.goto('/campaigns');
  const response = await page.waitForResponse(
    (r) => r.url().includes('/api/v1/campaigns') && r.status() === 200,
  );
  const json = await response.json();
  expect(json.items).toEqual(expect.any(Array));
  if (json.items.length > 0) {
    await expect(page.getByRole('cell', { name: json.items[0].name })).toBeVisible();
  } else {
    await expect(page.getByText('No campaigns', { exact: true })).toBeVisible();
  }
});
```

**Good** -- **L2** mutation (sketch):

```javascript
const post = page.waitForResponse((r) => r.request().method() === 'POST' && r.url().includes('/api/v1/team/invites'));
await page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Send invite' }).click();
expect((await post).status()).toBe(201);
await expect(page.getByText(uniqueEmail)).toBeVisible();
```

**T1 ingest-only preamble** (required when claiming live API):

```javascript
