| ID | Lie | Falsify |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **RB-L1** | "Route protected" with only React Router / nav filter | `curl -b cookie` as `MB` -> `403` on page's primary GET |
| **RB-L2** | "User cannot access Ops" because link hidden | Direct `/ops` + `GET /api/v1/ops/home` must `403` for `MB` |
| **RB-L3** | `session/bootstrap` `permissions` cited as enforcement | Name handler `RequirePermission` + negative test **RB-S3** |
| **RB-L4** | Playwright login as admin proves RBAC | Run as seeded `MB` / role `U` on denied path |
| **RB-L5** | Client-side `canAccessSettings` without OpenAPI perm | Map to `settings:read` + server test |

### Deep-link contract (MB example)

Operator scenario: media buyer bookmarks `/ops/dlq`.

| Step | Expected |
| :--- | :--- |
| SPA route | May mount `OpsDlqPage` (no route guard today) |
| `GET /api/v1/ops/dlq` | `403` `FORBIDDEN` (requires `shards:read`) |
| UI | `ErrorBlock` or section `StubBanner` -- **not** empty table, not mock rows |
| Mutation buttons | Disabled or fail on click with same `403` |

Same pattern for `/audit` (`audit:read`), `/settings` (`settings:read`), `/rtb` (`rtb:read`).

